    "equivalence_margin": 1.1,
    "equivalence_rationale": "A 10% one-sided non-inferiority margin, provisional until this pilot measures the family's resolution; it is carried into the confirmatory addendum only if it strictly exceeds one plus the pilot-derived resolution. Pilot cells never yield a pass; the margin exists here so the pilot's recorded decisions are computed under the confirmation's rule.",
    "material_gap_threshold": 1.2,
    "material_gap_rationale": "A 20% gap in a nanosecond-scale transpose is the smallest difference worth attributing to a named cause (tile kernel, allocation, partial-word handling, geometry conversion) rather than to host noise; the pilot checks that it sits above the measured resolution before the confirmatory addendum freezes it."
  },
